#
# see default.ide for id ranges
#
# flags:
# 0x01 gets streamed out after 1 car is generated (for dumpsters, MrWoopy etc)
# 0x02 Don't use. Used by code internally.
#
# isvan - vehicle has van style rear doors.
#
# DefDirtLevel:
# describes default level of dirt on newly created cars:
# 0.0  -> dirt range is <0.0; 1.0> (full range - default)
# 0.5  -> dirt range is <0.5; 1.0>
# 0.75 -> dirt range is <0.75;1.0>
# etc.
#
#

# Texture dictionaries which are always resident
# Must come before cars
resident_txd

vehshare

end


cars
